to yellow.

537
00:21:07,800 --> 00:21:09,202
Yellow!

538
00:21:09,268 --> 00:21:11,003
- You know, it’s so exciting.

539
00:21:11,070 --> 00:21:13,207
It leaves me
perfectly speechless.

540
00:21:13,273 --> 00:21:16,008
- Did I tell you that I’ve got
my eye on some new oil land?

541
00:21:16,075 --> 00:21:17,577
- Oh, really?

542
00:21:17,643 --> 00:21:20,247
