560
00:21:50,343 --> 00:21:51,845
- Why don’t you let me prove it?

561
00:21:51,912 --> 00:21:54,513
- Please don’t touch,
Touch Conners.

562
00:21:54,580 --> 00:21:57,717
- I could do anything
as long as I was with you.

563
00:21:57,783 --> 00:21:59,285
- Tonight on Mannix,

564
00:21:59,352 --> 00:22:02,955
Touch Conners finds intrigue
and romance in bayou country.

565
00:22:03,023 --> 00:22:04,557
♪ Da dun da dun ♪

566
00:22:04,623 --> 00:22:05,758
