579
00:22:34,153 --> 00:22:36,288
- No, baby,
we’ll have to have a guide.

580
00:22:36,355 --> 00:22:39,392
- Oh, you can find your way
without any old guide.

581
00:22:39,458 --> 00:22:41,962
- I’m not sure
I’d live to tell the tale.

582
00:22:42,028 --> 00:22:45,398
- Rrrr! This is getting steamy.

583
00:22:45,465 --> 00:22:46,967
- What’s the matter?

584
00:22:47,033 --> 00:22:50,637
- I’m sorry, mister, I didn’t
mean to scare your little girl.

585
00:22:50,703 --> 00:22:52,705
- Don’t jump out
and start pawing people.

586
00:22:52,772 --> 00:22:54,908
- Be a sport, will you, pal?
Be a sport.

587
00:22:54,975 --> 00:22:57,643
Give me a little money
for a cup of coffee.

588
00:22:57,710 --> 00:22:59,212
- Yeah, okay, Senator.

589
00:22:59,278 --> 00:23:02,015
- Sure.

590
00:23:02,082 --> 00:23:05,152
Here, buy yourself
a dozen cups, black.

591
00:23:05,218 --> 00:23:07,620
- Is it okay if I just get
a couple of cups of coffee

592
00:23:07,687 --> 00:23:09,122
and maybe some donuts?

593
00:23:09,188 --> 00:23:11,123
I’m just going to stir a bit
of half-and-half in it, okay?

594
00:23:11,190 --> 00:23:13,227
Okay?

595
00:23:13,293 --> 00:23:14,795
- Played Touch Conners
like a piano.

596
00:23:17,497 --> 00:23:20,700
Hey, Mr. Mailer, how’s
The Naked and the Dead going?

597
00:23:22,335 --> 00:23:24,003
- Hey, it’s Pope Ed Asner.

598
00:23:24,070 --> 00:23:27,273
- [ imitating Ted Knight ] Let
me kiss your ring, Lou! Mmm...

599
00:23:27,340 --> 00:23:29,208
- [ imitating Ed Wynn ]
Hello, everybody, hello.

600
00:23:29,275 --> 00:23:31,745
The king commands you to get me
another drink!

601
00:23:33,380 --> 00:23:34,948
- Here's a novel idea--

602
00:23:35,015 --> 00:23:36,617
the parade stays still
and the crowd moves.

603
00:23:36,683 --> 00:23:38,852
It’s a new concept
from ConglomCo.

604
00:23:38,918 --> 00:23:40,253
[ humming ]

605
00:23:40,320 --> 00:23:41,622
- We're crayfish!

606
00:23:41,688 --> 00:23:43,257
Crack us in half and suck
the meat out of our tails!

607
00:23:43,323 --> 00:23:44,723
Ha ha ha ha!

608
00:23:44,792 --> 00:23:47,027
- Oh, the Banana Splits haven’t
aged very well, have they?

609
00:23:50,463 --> 00:23:51,998
- I do not know what we are.

610
00:23:52,065 --> 00:23:55,635
Perhaps we are Gauchos,
olé.

611
00:23:55,702 --> 00:23:56,837
- Gay caballeros.

612
00:23:56,903 --> 00:23:58,405
- Hmm.

613
00:23:58,472 --> 00:24:01,007
- And this must be Children of
Paradise all of a sudden.

614
00:24:01,073 --> 00:24:02,242
Whoa, gee.

615
00:24:04,945 --> 00:24:07,613
- Boy, the joy is just
pouring off those clowns.

616
00:24:07,680 --> 00:24:08,915
- Mm-hmm!

617
00:24:14,787 --> 00:24:16,288
- Man,
this looks like home movies

618
00:24:16,355 --> 00:24:17,823
