619
00:24:19,292 --> 00:24:21,495
- What a great place
for a date.

620
00:24:24,832 --> 00:24:27,833
- Hey, look,
it’s Fred Mertz in Gigi.

621
00:24:27,900 --> 00:24:29,235
[ French accent ]
♪ Lick it up ♪

622
00:24:29,302 --> 00:24:30,670
♪ Lick it up ♪

623
00:24:30,737 --> 00:24:32,838
♪ Lick it
like a piece of cake ♪

624
00:24:32,905 --> 00:24:35,042
Ha ha ha!
What do you think?

625
00:24:37,110 --> 00:24:38,545
- Can you see all right, baby?

626
00:24:38,612 --> 00:24:39,847
- Oh, just perfect, honey.

627
00:24:39,913 --> 00:24:43,417
- Hey, buddy, could you spare
a little old dime?

628
00:24:43,483 --> 00:24:45,452
- I just gave you...

629
00:24:45,518 --> 00:24:47,053
- Hey, what gives?

630
00:24:47,120 --> 00:24:48,322
- Say, just a minute.

631
00:24:48,388 --> 00:24:50,123
You got quite a bit of my money,
