632
00:24:50,190 --> 00:24:52,092
- I don’t know what
you’re talking about, bud.

633
00:24:52,158 --> 00:24:54,327
- Come on, hand it over.

634
00:24:54,393 --> 00:24:55,928
- Let go of me.

635
00:24:55,995 --> 00:24:57,963
- [ woman gasps ]

636
00:24:58,030 --> 00:25:00,500
- All right, Charlie,
