638
00:25:13,513 --> 00:25:15,648
- Oh, great, Joel!
That was really great.

639
00:25:15,715 --> 00:25:16,850
Look, I got to go.
I got some stuff to do.

640
00:25:16,917 --> 00:25:18,352
- Hold on a second, Crow.

641
00:25:18,418 --> 00:25:20,187
We're going to do
an old Simon and Garfunkel tune

642
00:25:20,253 --> 00:25:21,588
