643
00:25:21,655 --> 00:25:23,623
and you can help me by singing
the la-la-la parts, okay?

644
00:25:23,690 --> 00:25:25,358
♪ I am just a poor boy
and... ♪

645
00:25:25,425 --> 00:25:26,760
- Hi, Joel. Crow.
- Hi.

646
00:25:26,827 --> 00:25:29,462
- Tom Servo, hey, hey, buddy,
old pal, join us.

647
00:25:29,528 --> 00:25:31,130
- Okay. Sure thing.

648
00:25:31,197 --> 00:25:33,833
Oh, say guys,
saw that short on dating.

649
00:25:33,900 --> 00:25:35,768
Thinking
of asking that Gypsy out.

650
00:25:35,835 --> 00:25:36,937
What do you think?

651
00:25:37,003 --> 00:25:38,738
- Oh, Tom, are you sure
you want to do that?

652
00:25:38,805 --> 00:25:42,042
I mean, I'm positive Gypsy likes
you as another fellow robot,

653
00:25:42,108 --> 00:25:44,277
