667
00:26:04,630 --> 00:26:05,565
- Okay,
I guess you’re right.

668
00:26:05,632 --> 00:26:06,933
Stupid idea.

669
00:26:07,000 --> 00:26:08,968
Just wanted to see what
all the fuss about dating was.

670
00:26:09,035 --> 00:26:12,138
- You know, Tom, it probably
wouldn’t hurt to ask her.

671
00:26:12,205 --> 00:26:16,275
- Really? Yeah, okay, okay,
okay, okay, okay, okay!

672
00:26:16,342 --> 00:26:17,777
Any advice?

673
00:26:17,843 --> 00:26:21,113
- Yeah, just be yourself,
you know, don’t get nervous.

674
00:26:21,180 --> 00:26:23,283
- Don’t invoice her for
your expenditures on the date.

675
00:26:23,350 --> 00:26:24,817
- Okay, good.

676
00:26:24,883 --> 00:26:26,653
- I probably wouldn’t show her
my Hummel collection just yet.

677
00:26:26,720 --> 00:26:28,087
- Point taken. Mm-hmm.

678
00:26:28,153 --> 00:26:30,790
- Avoid boring her with your
knowledge of war atrocities.

679
00:26:30,857 --> 00:26:32,325
- Oh, I’m not stupid.

680
00:26:32,392 --> 00:26:34,927
- You know, Tom, you’re going
to need someplace to take her.

681
00:26:34,995 --> 00:26:37,997
- Yeah, not a lot going on up
here, though.

682
00:26:38,063 --> 00:26:39,598
