it a little thought.

689
00:26:50,977 --> 00:26:51,945
We’ll be right back.

690
00:26:52,012 --> 00:26:53,580
- Turn it off!
Turn it off!

691
00:26:59,152 --> 00:27:02,288
- We could play splatball
down in the loading bay.

692
00:27:02,355 --> 00:27:05,092
- Uh, maybe.

693
00:27:05,158 --> 00:27:08,160
- What? Can't a guy even have
a couple of drinks to celebrate?

694
00:27:08,227 --> 00:27:10,097
What’s the matter with you guys?

695
00:27:10,163 --> 00:27:11,463
- Is Captain Goodrich in?

696
00:27:11,530 --> 00:27:13,232
- Yes, Lieutenant,
I'll tell him you're here.

697
00:27:13,298 --> 00:27:14,800
- Say, lady.

698
00:27:14,867 --> 00:27:16,670
Just like today,
the rest of the guys

699
00:27:16,737 --> 00:27:19,105
