during Mardi Gras.

700
00:27:19,172 --> 00:27:21,007
- Course, Officer,
he’s not drunk.

701
00:27:21,073 --> 00:27:22,042
- I am, too.

702
00:27:22,075 --> 00:27:23,477
- Is this your liver?

703
00:27:23,510 --> 00:27:25,145
- Otherwise, you wouldn't have
been able to take this

704
00:27:25,212 --> 00:27:26,612
away from me so nimbly.

705
00:27:26,680 --> 00:27:29,148
If I were drunk, I wouldn’t have
been able to take it back.

706
00:27:29,215 --> 00:27:30,750
- Captain Goodrich
will see you now.

707
00:27:30,817 --> 00:27:33,152
- Thank you.
Officer, book him.

708
00:27:33,218 --> 00:27:35,288
- Why is he taking orders
from a crossing guard?

709
00:27:35,355 --> 00:27:38,992
- Hmm...Yes, I am
the police chief of France,

710
00:27:39,058 --> 00:27:40,727
Vichy New Orleans.

711
00:27:40,793 --> 00:27:42,828
- Oh, that mob out there is
really something.

712
00:27:42,895 --> 00:27:44,897
- A little above and
beyond the line of duty, hmm?

713
00:27:44,963 --> 00:27:45,898
- It certainly is.

714
00:27:45,965 --> 00:27:47,067
- Give us a kiss.

715
00:27:47,133 --> 00:27:48,568
- So's your plan, Lee.

716
00:27:48,635 --> 00:27:49,968
- It might work, Captain.

717
00:27:50,037 --> 00:27:51,203
